{"id":"vod_bf_1369","vodId":"1369","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"暗之末裔","name_cn":"暗之末裔","date":"2000-01-01","year":"2000","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-2/9baccb9122349f2ed1c2b69468cc6b65.jpg"},"summary":"在幽暗可怖的冥府之中，有一个相当于警察局的，被称为“十王厅”的神秘机构，除了审判一些罪孽深重的死者外，十王厅还担当了调查人间非正常死亡事件的重要职责。个性开朗平和的青年都筑麻斗（三木真一郎 配音）就供职于此，有着丰富办案经验的他渐渐成为了十王厅的顶梁柱。　　长崎发生了一连串的不思议杀人事件，疑为凶残嗜血的吸血鬼所为。为了调查事件的真相，都筑麻斗和其搭档黑崎密（浅野麻由美 配音）开始了他们危险的旅程。在好友亘理温（关俊彦 配音）和巽真一郎（森川智之 配音）的帮助下，所有线索指向了名为邑辉一贵（速水奖 配音）的变态医师身上。令密没有想到的是，在过去，邑辉一贵和都筑麻斗竟然还有着说不清道不明的纠葛关联，而早已被埋没的，麻斗的过去也渐渐的浮出了水面。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画,情,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:20:41","classic":true,"classicRank":38,"franchise":"死神","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/anzhimoyi/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T15:02:10.908Z"}